The {{Term/Store|Sword Monk's Shrine||Series, BotW}} is a mini-[[Dungeon]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Color BotW|Monk Blue|{{Big|'''Beginning Trials'''}}<br/>'''Sword Monk's Shrine'''}}|Game Screen|BotW}}</ref> It is the place where the [[Trial of the Sword]] takes place.<ref>{{Cite|It is called the Trial of the Sword. It will challenge you as you have never been challenged before.|Great Deku Tree|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack.

