==Trivia==
*The Sword Monk's Shrine was originally called the Cave of Trials during the Expansion Pass announcement.<ref>{{Cite Web|quote= |author= Nintendo |published= February 14, 2017 |retrieved= May 2, 2017 |url= https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vbbZslUchyA |title= The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild Expansion Pass|site= YouTube|type= Video}}</ref>
*Each of the seven [[Monk]]s at the end of the Sword Monk's Shrine have posed their arms in a way that mimics the poses of the seven [[Sage]]s when they were sealing [[Ganon]] in {{OoT}}.<ref>{{Cite Web|quote= Okay, so I just finished the Trial of the Sword and immediately noticed the 7 monks are representing the 7 Sages.|author= kamuilyn |published= April 16, 2018 |retrieved= April 18, 2018 |url= https://www.reddit.com/r/Breath_of_the_Wild/comments/8cl9gl |title= Okay, so I just finished the Trial of the Sword and immediately noticed the 7 monks are representing the 7 Sages. : Breath_of_the_Wild |site= Reddit |type= }}</ref>
*Any [[Monster]]s killed inside of the Sword Monk's Shrine will not be added to the hidden point counter that determines Monster difficulty scaling throughout [[Hyrule]],{{Verify}} and all Monsters in the Sword Monk's Shrine will not be changed based on this value. All Monsters have a set difficulty status inside the Sword Monk's Shrine.

